{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2023-04-11 10:41:00', 'title': 'RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES AND SPIDEROAK COLLABORATE TO SECURE SATELLITE COMMUNICATIONS IN PROLIFERATED LOW-EARTH ORBIT', 'text': "CAMBRIDGE, MASS., APRIL 11, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES' (NYSE: RTX) BBN DIVISION AND SPIDEROAK ANNOUNCED A STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP TO DEVELOP AND FIELD A NEW GENERATION OF ZERO-TRUST SECURITY SYSTEMS FOR SATELLITE COMMUNICATIONS IN PROLIFERATED LOW-EARTH ORBIT, OR PLEO."}